      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "家兄则在甲府出色地继承了家业。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My elder brother, on the other hand, carried on the family business admirably in Kofu.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00869",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "家里用不着我。”",
